Subject: [PATCH 08/13] FeatureGate: BlockedNotifier toast

Shows 'Blocked by FeatureGate: <feature> (<reason>)' on system_server's
shared UiThread, rate-limited per feature with elapsedRealtime().
FeatureGateInternal.notifyBlocked builds the reason under the lock and
shows the toast outside it. cmd feature_gate notify-blocked for testing.

Change-Id: Ia3b5bfddc285c7929799911652d40ac77dc9375b
